ty&rsquo;s 4 grids May to June came in under 90% of normal in 35 of 75 years. In 2025 that same middle saw May to June at 156% of normal and November to December at 46%. So far in 2026, February to March came in at 42%. On grid 15462, a preliminary estimate puts August to September 2026 at 74.7, and RMA&rsquo;s final index can differ.</p>"}
